WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:05.815 --> 00:01:07.567
Come with me.

00:01:08.318 --> 00:01:09.360
What?

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:13.031
Until a certain issue is resolved,
I'm going to have you hide.

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:16.618
If you obey me calmly,

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:18.620
I will ensure your safety.

00:01:18.703 --> 00:01:23.500
Y-You’re telling me to believe you?
The one who killed Zachary?

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:24.626
It wasn't me!

00:01:28.213 --> 00:01:30.882
It's too bad,
but Kirisame was right, huh?

00:01:32.717 --> 00:01:37.138
It seems you're not determined
to join our side.

00:01:38.056 --> 00:01:39.390
What are you talking about?

00:01:40.308 --> 00:01:42.227
The plan is already in motion.

00:01:42.352 --> 00:01:45.855
We don't have time,
so we'll force things forward.

00:02:03.873 --> 00:02:06.334
Why are you protecting him?

00:02:06.417 --> 00:02:09.045
Kirisame ordered you
to kill him, right?

00:03:00.138 --> 00:03:04.058
As expected, it was just like you said.

00:03:06.102 --> 00:03:10.356
Yes, I understand.
No problem, I'll do it myself.

